  "text": "proprium.cathedra-sancti-petri-postcommunio",
  "about": "The postcommunio of the formulary “Chair of Saint Peter the Apostle” in the 1962 Roman Missal.",
  "segments": {
    "s01": { "translation": "O Lord, may the gift we offer bring us joy, that as we praise Your wondrous work in Your Apostle Peter, so through him may we share Your generous forgiveness. Through our Lord Jesus Christ, Thy Son, who liveth and reigneth with Thee in the unity of the Holy Ghost, God, world without end. Amen." }
